  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read current `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` handleRecordNumberClick block. Confirm 7-anchor version state at 1.3.4.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add resolveClickTarget helper">Add module-level function `resolveClickTarget(selectedTarget)` that returns `{ entityName, entityId } | null`. Priority: (1) selectedTarget when populated; (2) parse etn+id from `sprk_regardingrecordurl` Xrm.Page attribute; (3) fallback to `sprk_regardingrecordid` + entityType hint. All paths defensive — try/catch, no throw.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Update handleRecordNumberClick">Replace direct `selectedTarget?.entityType / recordId` reads with `resolveClickTarget(selectedTarget)`. If null → warn + no-op (existing empty-state behavior). Otherwise call navigateTo with resolved values.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Update docstring">Bump v1.3.4 references to v1.3.5 in the file docstring header. Add a "# v1.3.5 (SRFR-042 hyperlink onLoad fix)" section describing the bug + fix.</step>
