    <step order="10" name="Version bump — Location 7 (pack.ps1)">Update `$version = "1.3.5"`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Tests update">Bulk replace 1.3.4 → 1.3.5. Add 3 new tests for the pre-loaded-record path.</step>
    <step order="12" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.4` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin + docstring version-history section). Assert zero non-history hits.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Invoke `/code-review` and `/adr-check` on modified files. Address findings or escalate per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod`. Confirm build passes.</step>
