    <step order="16" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.5.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list | Select-String RegardingResolver` shows Version 1.3.5.</step>
    <step order="17" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-042 status → completed. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add SRFR-042 row. Reset current-task.md.</step>
