  <notes><![CDATA[
Owner bug report post-v1.3.4 deploy. Row 2 hyperlink no-op on pre-loaded
records because `selectedTarget` React state is only populated by picker
onSelect. Fix derives entityName + entityId from Xrm.Page attributes
(primary path: parse etn+id from sprk_regardingrecordurl) when
selectedTarget is null. Additive, no manifest changes, no shared-lib
changes.
  ]]></notes>
</task>
